00:05:23.822 --> 00:05:26.359
Do you get any mail
that you're into?

00:05:26.359 --> 00:05:30.763
-I get my old roommate Mitra's
mail a lot.

00:05:30.763 --> 00:05:32.364
-Yeah. Do you go through it?

00:05:32.364 --> 00:05:33.598
-Yeah.
[ Laughter ]

00:05:33.598 --> 00:05:34.900
I slice it right open.

00:05:34.900 --> 00:05:36.502
My mouth is watering
when the mail comes.

00:05:36.502 --> 00:05:37.870
I'm like, at the mail slot,

00:05:37.870 --> 00:05:39.438
