through the thing.

00:05:39.438 --> 00:05:41.941
The mailman's like, "No, no,"
and I always grab his arm.

00:05:41.941 --> 00:05:44.610
[ Laughter ]
It's like "It," Pennywise.

00:05:44.610 --> 00:05:46.145
-He should have learned
at this point

00:05:46.145 --> 00:05:48.180
