so close to the slot.

00:05:48.180 --> 00:05:51.751
-Yeah, my mailman puts his
whole arm in my mail slot.

00:05:51.751 --> 00:05:54.553
-I think that's his turn-on, is
to get grabbed through the slot.

00:05:54.553 --> 00:05:58.257
-Hey, it's whatever.
-Whatever.

00:05:58.257 --> 00:06:00.659
