00:06:52.645 --> 00:06:56.115
Is it okay if...

00:06:56.115 --> 00:07:00.119
Okay. This is like
a 1999 Honda Accord.

00:07:00.119 --> 00:07:02.454
I'm going to try
and speed-draw this.

00:07:02.454 --> 00:07:04.423
And yeah, I do have a brand deal
